# RPCEmuGfx module version, in the RISC OS VersionNum style.
#
# The Makefile turns this into version.inc, which supplies the module's help
# string. Bump both fields together when the module changes.
#
# The date is deliberate rather than a true build stamp: the assembled module is
# committed to the repository as gfxroms/RPCEmuGfx,ffa and only rebuilt when
# someone runs build.sh --podules, so a real build date would record when that
# last happened rather than anything a user could act on. Override at build time
# with `make MODULE_DATE="..."` if you do want a stamp.

Module_MajorVersion	0.02
Module_Date		03 Aug 2026
